WEBVTT

00:00:09,140 --> 00:00:14,180
Before starting with Qatar's clinic, I went to a naturopath. Should I continue?

00:00:15,300 --> 00:00:23,300
Well, you can. So, you know, understand, you know, I have always said, you know, I want you to do

00:00:23,300 --> 00:00:29,860
what you feel like God is leading you to do. We have lots of people that are talking, they're going

00:00:29,860 --> 00:00:34,820
to a car pastor or going to a naturopath or going to a nutritionist and getting advice as well,

00:00:35,540 --> 00:00:40,980
and sometimes it's really good to have somebody local that you can talk to and that makes you feel good

00:00:40,980 --> 00:00:47,460
and there's all sorts of benefits to that. And if you see a benefit to that then by all means

00:00:48,260 --> 00:00:55,220
you don't go with that. But please, at least you don't have to take my opinion, you don't have to agree

00:00:55,220 --> 00:01:01,380
with me, you don't have to do anything I tell you to do. But this kind of question like this one

00:01:01,940 --> 00:01:08,100
back here, my college and powder has methylated multivitamins, should I discontinue? These are the

00:01:08,100 --> 00:01:15,220
kind of questions I need you to ask or I want you to ask because I, you know, there's lots of times

00:01:15,220 --> 00:01:20,500
where a person will have a question where they're taking things that I would have never recommended.

00:01:21,060 --> 00:01:26,500
Now, you might get a totally different argument from your naturopath and no, I want you to take that.

00:01:26,580 --> 00:01:31,460
You need methylated multivitamins. I'm, you know, sometimes people think I give too long of

00:01:31,460 --> 00:01:38,420
answers. I had somebody to the day that was unhappy with me because I explained things to them

00:01:38,420 --> 00:01:44,580
on the call too long. And I get it, I'm sorry, that's just the way I am, that's why I try to

00:01:45,700 --> 00:01:54,340
to give you education so that you are not just following somebody. But you're educated

00:01:54,340 --> 00:02:00,420
so you're making your own conscious decisions because now you know something that you didn't know

00:02:00,420 --> 00:02:06,740
before. So that's why I try to tell you about just against methylated multivitamins. There's a reason

00:02:06,740 --> 00:02:13,700
why a cancer patient wouldn't want to be taking methylated multivitamins. So I'm trying to give you

00:02:13,700 --> 00:02:19,540
that data so you can arm yourself. Now, there's a lot of practitioners that don't understand that.

00:02:20,100 --> 00:02:25,860
There's probably, there's tons of stuff I don't understand and I learn every day. But when we're

00:02:25,860 --> 00:02:35,620
open to learning, then we grow and we're better for it, I believe. So I'm not going to apologize for

00:02:35,620 --> 00:02:45,700
over teaching. So go ahead and go to your naturopath if you want to. They could have wonderful benefits for

00:02:45,700 --> 00:02:51,140
a lot of different things. But if they do recommend supplements that you have any questions about

00:02:51,140 --> 00:02:57,460
just ask, that's what these zoom calls are for, just ask. And I may say, sure, there's no harm in

00:02:57,460 --> 00:03:02,580
taking that. Or I may say, I don't think you should take that. And then you could make that decision.

00:03:02,580 --> 00:03:07,300
You don't have to do what I tell you to, but I'll give you my honest opinion. So absolutely,

00:03:07,300 --> 00:03:11,300
you can continue to take it. I had somebody on the phone the other day that said, I really want to

00:03:11,300 --> 00:03:15,460
find an herbalist. What do you want to find an herbalist for? Because I need to know what supplements to

00:03:15,460 --> 00:03:20,580
take. This is in a case here. I said, well, that's what I am. Oh, they were pleasantly surprised.

00:03:21,300 --> 00:03:28,660
Okay. Well, you know, ask me questions. If I don't know something, you know me well enough,

00:03:28,660 --> 00:03:33,860
and I'll say, I don't know. I don't know that answer. I'm not familiar with that. But if I do know

00:03:33,860 --> 00:03:40,180
something, I'll give you my opinion. And sometimes I need to correct that opinion because I was wrong.

00:03:40,180 --> 00:03:46,100
But let's just learn together. So I want you guys to be educated, make educated decisions so that you're

00:03:46,740 --> 00:03:57,060
you could help other people and not just follow someone.

